        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: InStyle, Godey's Lady's Book, Cosmopolitan Germany\n- People: Véronique Tristram\n- Organizations: Time Inc.\n- Places: United States, Philadelphia, Germany\n- Roles: Fashion Director, Deputy active fashion director\n\nFacts:\n- Godey's Lady's Book was a United States women's magazine published in Philadelphia from 1830 to 1878.\n- InStyle was founded in 1994.\n- InStyle is a monthly women's fashion magazine published in the United States by Time Inc.\n- Véronique Tristram was Deputy active fashion director of InStyle from 2000 to 2006.\n- Véronique Tristram was Fashion Director of Cosmopolitan Germany from 2006 to 2010.",
